---
import { CATEGORY_LIST } from '../lib/categories';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-white mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start justify-between gap-8 pb-8 border-b border-line">
      <div class="max-w-md">
        <a href="/" class="text-base font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-ink">
          REPLEDAITDA ARCHIVE
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">
          하이엔드 가죽 소재, 봉제 공정, 등급 체계 및 실물 검수(QC) 기준을 객관적으로 기록하는
          독립 리서치 아카이브입니다. 모든 아티클은 정보 제공 및 학습 목적으로 작성됩니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-xs tracking-[0.12em] uppercase">
        {CATEGORY_LIST.map((cat) => (
          <a href={cat.href} class="text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors">
            {cat.label}
          </a>
        ))}
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors">
          RSS
        </a>
        <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors">
          SITEMAP
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted">
      <p>&copy; {year} REPLEDAITDA ARCHIVE. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Independent Editorial &amp; Craftsmanship Research</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>